  "_source": "FishSol-v2.1.ahk 1440p, DoMouseMove2. Each step is [key, action, ms] for Input.PlayRoute: a FishSol 'Send {k Down}' or 'Send {k Up}' followed by 'sleep N' becomes [k, down|up, N]. QWERTY keys only (FishSol azerty option ignored). vip.toShop = 'Vip Pathing' L4299-4333 (after reset + camera zoom), vip.back = L4391-4397. nonvip.toShop = 'Non Vip Pathing' L4197-4231, nonvip.back = L4289-4295. Dialog and sell clicks live in coords.json. CraftTask reuses vip/nonvip toShop+back for the fisher (same shop NPC as selling: FishSol RunForcedRespawnAction 1440p L1781-2120 walks the identical path; its S tap is 200 ms vs 300 here and it zooms with i/o keys, Vesper reuses the sell wheel zoom). cauldron is an empty placeholder to record in game (craft respawns after the cauldron; merchants use the Merchant Teleporter, no routes).",
